{"last_link_id": 10, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1. max_audio_length_ms\n含义：最大音频长度，单位是毫秒（ms）\n作用：设置输入音频的最长允许时长。这里设为 240000，也就是240 秒（4 分钟）。\n超过这个时长的音频会被自动截断，确保模型处理的音频长度在设计范围内，避免内存溢出或性能问题。\n2. topk\n含义：Top-K 采样\n作用：生成时只从概率最高的前 K 个候选词中随机选择。这里设为 50。\n值越大，生成结果越丰富但可能发散；值越小，结果越聚焦但可能单调。\n它常用于文本生成、语音合成或音乐生成类模型，平衡多样性与连贯性。\n3. temperature\n含义：温度系数\n作用：控制生成结果的随机性。这里设为 1.0，是中性值。\n温度越高（>1），生成越随机、创意性越强；温度越低（<1），生成越保守、越倾向于高概率内容。\n1.0 表示完全按照模型预测的概率分布进行采样，不做额外调整。\n4. cfg_scale (Classifier-Free Guidance Scale)\n含义：无分类器引导系数\n作用：控制提示词（Prompt）对生成结果的影响强度。这里设为 1.5。\n值越高，生成结果越严格遵循提示词；值越低，生成结果更自由、受提示词约束更小。\n常见范围在 1~10 之间，1.5 属于较低的引导强度，适合希望保留一定生成自由度的场景。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [370.2872619628906, 274.8255920410156], "pos": [-276.03460693359375, 543.042724609375], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [8], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [331.57891845703125, 710.3072509765625], "pos": [-1104.505859375, 826.8206787109375], "widgets_values": ["[intro]\n窗外细雨轻轻洒，\n似你眉间愁绪挂。\n山河虽异隔天涯，\n心念相通共月华。\n\n[verse1]\n我吟古风你未解，\n你道今语我笑颜开。\n但眸中流转的情，\n却能穿越千年尘埃。\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你我之间，\n似隔云海，\n然情深意长未改。\n此情可译成诗篇，\n愿用余生细细裁。\n\n[Break]\n问世间，情为何物？\n\n[Chorus]\n此情可译成歌谣，\n在你身旁心自逍遥。\n此意可绘成画卷，\n在你眸中寻得依靠。\n\n[Verse 2]\n我言古韵你未识，\n你述新语我情痴。\n但眼中闪烁的星，\n却能照亮彼此心思。\n\n[Bridge]\n情深无需多言语，\n此刻共赏月华移。\n\n[Final Chorus]\n此情可译成歌谣，\n在你身旁梦亦甜笑。\n此意可绘成画卷，\n在你眸中永驻美好。\n\n[Outro]\n或许...情是唯一之语。\n心相印，\n意绵绵。\n\n[Ending with a soft sigh]"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [9], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [340.1315612792969, 440.42413330078125], "pos": [-732.9413452148438, 852.4788208007812], "widgets_values": ["pop ballad / melodic crossover\n72 bpm → 88 bpm（副歌升调，心跳加速）\nG major → B major（副歌升调，情感爆发）\nromantic / cinematic / heartbreak\n#popballad #crossover #love #suno5 #romantic #heartbreak"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio_output", "links": [10], "label": "audio_output", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio_output"}, {"name": "filepath", "label": "filepath", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filepath"}], "size": [400, 426], "pos": [-307.0984191894531, 872.1146850585938], "widgets_values": ["", "", "3B", "oss", 1014383403385018, "randomize", 240, 50, 1, 1.5, true, "auto", false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 8, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "link": 9, "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "version"}, "name": "version", "label": "version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "version"}, {"widget": {"name": "codec_version"}, "name": "codec_version", "label": "codec_version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "codec_version"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_audio_length_seconds"}, "name": "max_audio_length_seconds", "label": "max_audio_length_seconds", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_audio_length_seconds"}, {"widget": {"name": "topk"}, "name": "topk", "label": "topk", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "topk"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "tempera